SUMMARY:SGT. SPLENDOR-Kate Vargas and Eric McFadden
DESCRIPTION:Sgt. Splendor Kate Vargas and Eric McFadden \nBefore joining forces\, the duo behind Sgt. Splendor were already formidable solo artists\, Kate Vargas chalking up acclaim at outlets like NPR\, HuffPost and Vice (including praise from the “Dean of American Rock Critics” Robert Christgau); and Eric McFadden amassing an impressive resume including stints on guitar with George Clinton & the P-Funk All Stars\, Anders Osbourne\, Fishbone’s Angelo Moore\, and Eric Burdon & The Animals\, plus a slew of solo albums\, and session work with everyone from Jackson Browne to The Clash’s Joe Strummer.
URL:https://ranchonicasio.com/event/sgt-splendor-kate-vargas-and-eric-mcfadden-2/
LOCATION:Rancho Nicasio\, 1 Old Rancheria Rd\, Nicasio\, CA\, 94946\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ranchonicasio.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/sgtsplendor_resized.jpg
END:VEVENT
